<title>BELGIUM: Belgian OLOs close off highs but Bund spread down.</title>
<headline>Belgian OLOs close off highs but Bund spread down.</headline>
<text>
<p>1630 GMT - Linear bonds close off highs. OLO/Bund yld spread narrows three bp to 8 but expected to widen again. Franc continues recovery, closes near ERM midpoint of 20.6255.</p>
<p>*2007 OLO 5.63% (5.66) BE286=, 8 bps over Bunds (11)</p>
<p>*OLO fut +0.30 at 123.16 BGBc1 ; Mark/Bfr 20.6260/80 (6320/35)</p>
<p>*3-mo bill 3.35/39% (30/40), 1-wk repo 3.45/50 (40/50)</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
